command-description-npc-set_passive_task = Sets the entity as the target of a passive NPC task
command-description-npc-set_task = Sets an NPC task for the entity
command-description-npc-add_allowed_task = Adds an NPC task to the list of tasks the player can issue
command-description-npc-remove_allowed_task = Removes the NPC task from the list of tasks the player can issue
command-description-npc-add_control = Adds the entity to the list of NPCs that the player can control
command-description-npc-remove_control = Removes the entity from the list of NPCs that the player can control
